      "description": "DevIT - IBM Software\n\nDeveloped and maintained an internal private cloud platform for IBM developers, enabling self-service provisioning of virtual machines, OpenShift clusters, NFS storage, and other resources. Built the platform using open-source technologies including Ubuntu, PHP, Apache, MariaDB, KVM/QEMU, Ceph, DHCP, DNS, and FastAPI/Python. Designed RESTful APIs that enabled automated resource deployment within CI/CD pipelines, improving developer efficiency  and scalability. Managed platform reliability, security remediation, system patching, user support and infrastructure uptime across the environment.",
