      "description": "IBM Enhanced Secure Support - IBM Analytics\n​\nPlatform Team Lead supporting a government-regulated environment compliant with HIPAA security standards. Responsible for designing, implementing, and supporting enterprise infrastructure solutions focused on scalability, security, high availability, and fault tolerance. Designed, deployed, and managed a VMware virtualization environment consisting of 30+ ESXi hosts with FIPS 140-2 Level 3 compliant Data-At-Rest Encryption storage utilizing IBM SVC, IBM XIV, Cisco MDS, and Gemalto KeySecure. Led platform operations including infrastructure deployments, system administration, security compliance validation, audit readiness, incident support, and end-user assistance. Created technical documentation, operational procedures, and training materials while mentoring team members to improve platform reliability, knowledge sharing, and operational efficiency.",
